OL,3,ACritics celebrate Celine Dion's
OL,4,A'high-stakes' comeback show in Paris
OL,5,
OL,6,FDion, one of the best-selling musical
OL,7,Fartists of all time, has not performed
OL,8,Fa full show since a 2020 concert in New
OL,9,FJersey - the last before the Covid
OL,10,Fpandemic cut her tour short. In 2024,
OL,11,Fshe performed just one song at the
OL,12,FParis Olympics closing ceremony.
OL,14,FSaturday marked the first of Dion's
OL,15,F26-show residency at the Paris La
OL,16,FDefense Arena, Europe's largest covered
OL,17,Fconcert arena.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/18
