OL,3,A'Forget Notting Hill - we set our new
OL,4,Aromcom in the east end of Glasgow'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFilm fans have had plenty of chances to
OL,7,Fspot Glasgow on the big screen in
OL,8,Frecent years, from superhero
OL,9,Fblockbusters to futuristic sci-fi
OL,10,Fthrillers.
OL,12,FNow the city is to star in cinemas once
OL,13,Fagain - but the difference is that it
OL,14,Fwon't be doubling for another location.
OL,15,FIt is actually set in the city.
OL,17,FRomantic comedy Premature is out in
OL,18,Fcinemas next Friday, despite a
OL,19,Fmicroscopic budget that is the fraction
OL,20,Fof Hollywood productions like
OL,21,FSpider-Man: Brand New Day.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
